      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `287908f33cf38fb25e38bb161b747db68a76604a1ac5c818627048efcefb93bf--InnerWestLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | 4345a48c79940c5a93cdf217c30eeef13fa3f30b75eae19b8f9ee5d5a211a96a | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | 45eb9bb817067a9e5d81b4bcb66da3294bfaef179e2668eccbac74d9b5ed21d5 | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | bb4238a69680a11fecbc55df92fe51b01c4d5478491c5e0ca8adc0865fe894c9 | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | 517c7194e47818e29db7cc3244c895c1bddc09f40cd429bf0b9c63930cf69f1f | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | 158f9429490a510ce78f94372a37498dbeacf2ec5d9dbc902fe2a98eac2ca91e | missing |\n| \"Month\" | 253cce723e78a9d89460f820989ab571e5e29232f4a6e43af3180ef5745cfe65 | missing |\n| \"Time\" | 6710915bd6b45a3b4078560a9121d4e92a082ccd3f997c805271382b702b686b | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
